    "content": "pluginManagement {\n    repositories {\n        google()\n        mavenCentral()\n        gradlePluginPortal()\n    }\n}\ndependencyResolutionManagement {\n    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.FAIL_ON_PROJECT_REPOS)\n    repositories {\n        google()\n        mavenCentral()\n    }\n}\n\nrootProject.name = \"MFS Charge Calculator\"\ninclude(\":app\")\n"
